## Example Walkthrough

### Input

```text
[1,3,2]
```

### Find `i`

Start from the right:

```text
3 >= 2 → move left
1 < 3  → stop
```

So:

```text
i = 0
```

### Find `j`

Search from the right:

```text
2 > 1 → found
```

So:

```text
j = 2
```

Swap:

```text
[1,3,2]
 ↑   ↑
 i   j

      ↓

[2,3,1]
```

### Reverse the part after `i`

```text
[2 | 3,1]
      ↓
[2 | 1,3]
```

Final result:

```text
[2,1,3]
```

